    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on thompson1917-ch05-26: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.56";
    dc:description "Modern cytoskeletal measurements provide a plausible operationalization of 'elastic fibrillae.' Open ultrastructure can test spatial association for selected cells, but causal restraint and mechanical properties usually require new perturbations.";
