    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Elasticity is not inferable reliably from fixed ultrastructure.", "Sparse taxonomic coverage limits the broad generalization.";
